                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Super Meat Boy on crack.\n\nHeads Run game with an incredible audiovisual presentation, and a player character so fast and precise that precision platforming feels almost impossible, at least on a casual playthrough, and it reflects in the S rank time requirements, too.\n\nOthers have cited visibility as an issue, but personally, I think of this more as an exercise in utter overload than a conventional platformer, so 'tis all just part of the experience!",
